,"id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commit/960f3c5dc2bbb718e1f30b37c2f35024ea671089","node_id":"C_kwDORGtmsNoAKDk2MGYzYzVkYzJiYmI3MThlMWYzMGIzN2MyZjM1MDI0ZWE2NzEwODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commit/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe","sha":"2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe"}],"sha":"960f3c5dc2bbb718e1f30b37c2f35024ea671089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/960f3c5dc2bbb718e1f30b37c2f35024ea671089"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24678549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof","id":24678549,"login":"Goosterhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Njc4NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:14:46Z","email":"gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com","name":"Gerard Oosterhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:14:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(hooks): commit-msg prefers nvm node over Windows npx under WSL (#475)\n\npre-commit and pre-push both carry the WSL PATH guard; commit-msg did\nnot. In a non-interactive shell with no node on PATH but Windows npx\nvisible, `npx commitlint` died with \"WSL 1 is not supported... Could not\ndetermine Node.js install directory\". The commit failed, with output that\nreads like a lint failure. The guard is copied in, checking npx (the tool\nthis hook calls), and with `|| true` on the lookups, because this hook\nruns under set -e.\n\nTeeth, real commits in a linked worktree with that PATH:\n- old hook: exit 1, \"Could not determine Node.js install directory\";\n- new hook, valid message: exit 0;\n- new hook, invalid message: exit 1 (commitlint subject-empty), so the\n  lint really runs and is not skipped.\n\nRefs war-room WR-1971.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb498226bca940418ddc3fbfb11b2d26d2ef10ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/cb498226bca940418ddc3fbfb11b2d26d2ef10ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe","verification":{"payload":"tree cb498226bca940418ddc3fbfb11b2d26d2ef10ec\nparent 8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1790972086 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790972086 +0200\n\nfix(hooks): commit-msg prefers nvm node over Windows npx under WSL (#475)\n\npre-commit and pre-push both carry the WSL PATH guard; commit-msg did\nnot. In a non-interactive shell with no node on PATH but Windows npx\nvisible, `npx commitlint` died with \"WSL 1 is not supported... Could not\ndetermine Node.js install directory\". The commit failed, with output that\nreads like a lint failure. The guard is copied in, checking npx (the tool\nthis hook calls), and with `|| true` on the lookups, because this hook\nruns under set -e.\n\nTeeth, real commits in a linked worktree with that PATH:\n- old hook: exit 1, \"Could not determine Node.js install directory\";\n- new hook, valid message: exit 0;\n- new hook, invalid message: exit 1 (commitlint subject-empty), so the\n  lint really runs and is not skipped.\n\nRefs war-room WR-1971.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwBC2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9L0QAEB4TRI9LbFkll6G/aLD98VU\nKKyAFx6fY5mbSN+RK0HmBpm2/LFMBesSyChpkb3YPQ7TLBZo9P/mt1l5d4ESKMpS\nOFy9WxHaBtICRDCaFV/ka6KGXxybUG0gdWSaywy9jWQ0Ua4ONmBddNw7RwlzUmAd\nzqBmjKa+hWIKX3dxnQVfvfMz1dWWgXSGSQB6V+ov5bJnigsl+mGHzyDYX2MzHoZV\ns78UFUcOIwrtT7z/N7RbMkqmOhAVqrer5HVzVn6phUnP7vzoiGJWDaTjAsGI8GOX\nS4tN/2sHK9GUwCO1r15AtXhCzDQUkaFdiV1O0c/ZHJHSzUiFgDt2mnRKFFCWck3O\nhoUVTjgeEcVw1TJ6pyLItBLsdHxAauKiSsWtmMo7oWvZAbrD5OFa4Ywhn1KO6EAX\nDYciWqvc8WPV9eN3bQ6yjcujQ9r5ougqT07+Ehf409Su8bT4gcEx/iRH/uWeJCUl\nVk6SlgjbwbuZa8ONSxinMSwbrfoe7frBMnxukQRHd5SaVjRoVwc3Sxr34RI+PVHW\n0mIQ0m1uEj5TgxpkZ2F9iodqC+xcndgePClGOpppNF5SaxHQnvfxgzQwU/mrXxX8\nojdpL1kofBa3tuetbz7XyUUmdf9MIEu/5NtkYewu68HM7NyXxwPRa6EyrJ+ivqvB\n1k6VjbhXHNu+ok1e4UBs\n=i/ps\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T20:14:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commit/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe","node_id":"C_kwDORGtmsNoAKDIzMzAxOTJmMmRlMjk0ZDdmM2Q5MTdhYmViOWUwM2IwZjEzNmVkYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commit/8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274","sha":"8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274"}],"sha":"2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/2330192f2de294d7f3d917abeb9e03b0f136edbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24678549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof","id":24678549,"login":"Goosterhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Njc4NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:14:41Z","email":"gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com","name":"Gerard Oosterhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:14:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): track @types/node to the Node 24 runtime (#474)\n\n* chore(deps): track @types/node to the Node 24 runtime\n\nThe runtime is Node 24 (setup-node in frontend-ci and e2e, frontend\nengines >=24), but frontend carried @types/node ^26 and e2e ^22. A\nhigher types major lets code compile against Node APIs the runtime does\nnot have. A lower one hides APIs it does.\n\nBoth move to ^24, and the /frontend npm block gains the canonical\n@types/node semver-major ignore, which is why the frontend had drifted\nto 26.\n\nRefs WR-1970 (war-room board; Node 24 fleet target, ruling 2026-10-02).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\n* chore(deps): watch e2e/ with dependabot\n\ne2e/ has its own package.json and lock (@playwright/test, @types/node),\nbut dependabot had npm blocks for /frontend only, which is how e2e''s\n@types/node sat at ^22 for six months. Adds an /e2e npm block with the\nsame @types/node semver-major ignore.\n\nRefs war-room WR-1971.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33d4d97691142b4e67b229d3daa4e0782cc3c146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/33d4d97691142b4e67b229d3daa4e0782cc3c146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/8ae73735ad2facf759e485b5a928e1c655631274","verification":{"payload":"tree 33d4d97691142b4e67b229d3daa4e0782cc3c146\nparent 0cba6dc8e496b3586db864758b40d2676702a127\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1790972081 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790972081 +0200\n\nchore(deps): track @types/node to the Node 24 runtime (#474)\n\n* chore(deps): track @types/node to the Node 24 runtime\n\nThe runtime is Node 24 (setup-node in frontend-ci and e2e, frontend\nengines >=24), but frontend carried @types/node ^26 and e2e ^22. A\nhigher types major lets code compile against Node APIs the runtime does\nnot have. A lower one hides APIs it does.\n\nBoth move to ^24, and the /frontend npm block gains the canonical\n@types/node semver-major ignore, which is why the frontend had drifted\nto 26.\n\nRefs WR-1970 (war-room board; Node 24 fleet target, ruling 2026-10-02).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\n* chore(deps): watch e2e/ with dependabot\n\ne2e/ has its own package.json and lock (@playwright/test, @types/node),\nbut dependabot had npm blocks for /frontend only, which is how e2e''s\n@types/node sat at ^22 for six months. Adds an /e2e npm block with the\nsame @types/node semver-major ignore.\n\nRefs war-room WR-1971.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAwmNqeK9UyeHjycf5YJDi\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwBCxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjTAQAG4bdHvfYAw5gYPMcYblEEP+\nssty2ul8GTZ4DSndUu+fFI2czbmZs8ARhmhM57zY29z15NegMLZ3yh4X67bVGVX8\nDMGHCF1lovbhm2l/niU12xNG8E2k8dwiZc3unJ8+RVvHEr+6E8mkkrtDyzZvWCre\nMznZNTZIF75Mn7qLEKMGVpErXTMTe5DRQ8M0njiItyW6yZmmfRTEcf1Vx3dqLadA\nhOO3zZ17PzyrnItacofrDm0g0d7eDQCgie3A2KjRO3bnJ+ojqXLNlndSosOJr2tn\nn9HGFJ84bmkMZsno19FAabGaj5SyzQy5KpqgXMy2Gpe/m3heN9PCmCZqZcov5rUY\nYH7LpbjUNUdsfTxDAY6YK3c8rutaNyheMTUmMPL/RQ33VBTGVnh/P/pkElJLpG7o\nXi2NB2xPvctV/59vO8aSKH8Ug/qO6m+0ZruYE0nPEj46b94ajyuqMFglfbAl+iRB\nE3SYe44A9Zi+2x+Hbs13yx9Lk4HKympBErXyiz5Qc6l4rdIYq2koxaR0wU5FNFnk\nJfKnxWgxr0rmk17v5/Vrvf3/jKViaBPQlOJBxqapYDeuM+ZyBhyKUs4P51Qg1l4L\nzAJjJsqCqOtruh/nrXL/RC5GrSaWIdR+DHnDY3PuhFOTedGDR1EhZZSklQemrFBo\nA5br8/1GR63N+ASZRUwW\n=9Hr2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T20:14:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type"