ymous-class path redaction (WR-0798)\n- BSN eleven-test\n\nAnonymous-class error groups re-fingerprint once on upgrade.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uoy4BYHreq8XvXZdLjMQ15\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa7f39d0feaf29e00f1773e6275f42bc0e547250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/aa7f39d0feaf29e00f1773e6275f42bc0e547250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/7250387c1aad44581af0463d60c3af3bb468b21a","verification":{"payload":"tree aa7f39d0feaf29e00f1773e6275f42bc0e547250\nparent 9c3240e43e25c84a8c4dc83b70605f9616242e07\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1790855867 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790855867 +0200\n\nchore(deps): bump kendo-error-tracker to v0.1.2 (WR-0797) (#471)\n\nLock-only: the ^0.1.0 constraint already admits 0.1.2. v0.1.2 is the\nfirst tagged release of the KD-0887 scrubber hardening; BIO reports every\nexception through ErrorTracker::report() (bootstrap/app.php), so these\nredactions now apply before anything leaves the app:\n\n- DSN passwords, including an empty username (redis://:pass@host)\n- Stripe and AWS keys, IPv4 addresses\n- QueryException / PDOException carrier strip: bound SQL parameters no\n  longer leave the app\n- PathNormalizer username fallback\n- anonymous-class path redaction (WR-0798)\n- BSN eleven-test\n\nAnonymous-class error groups re-fingerprint once on upgrade.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uoy4BYHreq8XvXZdLjMQ15\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvkq7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADb0QAAkXfrIZGM0IuYnLk0xj26xE\nWsI04JpJ3545Jj6zpJxYp3e6ynmc4qLHOfXJygz2GNvNdS0BmnIBo1rYZDKQdFzT\nHVaXEF497quNF8tPqR5oTQZDYKCTuiXAabggobGMKDGcRk8+xvDoQOeViy/wxE3k\no64Rdd/e/bEUYJpjQ/yb3SmG8EkuUKpRr+DjGpoCMp94/u