70f7c61eeb63511a120b212d524d4b7779","sha":"287d7a70f7c61eeb63511a120b212d524d4b7779","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/287d7a70f7c61eeb63511a120b212d524d4b7779"}],"sha":"9c3240e43e25c84a8c4dc83b70605f9616242e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/9c3240e43e25c84a8c4dc83b70605f9616242e07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24678549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof","id":24678549,"login":"Goosterhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Njc4NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/287d7a70f7c61eeb63511a120b212d524d4b7779/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:56:36Z","email":"gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com","name":"Gerard Oosterhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T20:56:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(hooks): one light hook layer + in-tree tool caches + CI lint caches (#459)\n\n* chore(ci): light git hooks, in-tree tool caches, CI lint caches (WR-1785)\n\nHooks move to the ADR-0028 Amendment 2 shape and the root .githooks/ becomes\nthe only hook layer. CaptainHook (captainhook.json + both packages) and the\nfrontend/.husky/ scripts are removed.\n\n- pre-commit: pint writes and re-stages the staged PHP; a file with unstaged\n  edits gets pint --test only. Frontend keeps the registry regeneration and\n  lint-staged, now with --concurrent false and a worktree-private backup\n  instead of lint-staged''s refs/stash backup.\n- pre-push: range touches backend/ -> phpstan, phpstan:types, composer audit;\n  frontend/ outside *.md -> vue-tsc. No stdin runs every gate. Pest, Rector,\n  Deptrac, Vitest, knip and the build are CI only.\n- Pint cache-file, PHPStan tmpDir (one per config) in storage/, git-ignored;\n  pint:test runs --parallel.\n- backend-ci lint job restores/saves the Pint, Rector (PR restore, push save)\n  and PHPStan caches, keyed on config + composer.lock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012rp6fJpPHeUVX7WhPRG37S\n\n* fix(hooks): hand Pint only the staged files its own finder formats\n\nPint formats every path it is handed and skips its finder, so the pre-commit\nrewrote staged *.blade.php files (two are tracked here) and anything else\nPint excludes (_ide_helper*.php, storage/, pint.json exclude/notPath/notName).\nThe hook now asks Pint''s finder, loaded from the installed phar, which staged\nfiles it formats (the same intersection `pint --dirty` makes) and fails loudly\nif that probe fails or finds nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012rp6fJpPHeUVX7WhPRG37S\n\n* fix(hooks): refuse a partially staged frontend file before lint-staged runs\n\n`--no-stash` implies `--no-hide-partially-staged`, so lint-staged''s tasks\nwrote the whole working-tree file and re-added it, unstaged hunks included.\nThe frontend now refuses such a file, as the backend already refuses to let\npint write one. Teeth-proved: a partially staged .ts exits 1 with the file\nnamed; the same file fully staged passes the new check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PyoWBg8kexGpWQ4yhR5Fch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fec10fb4fce2b99dfbeec1f319e3e16df6f29a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/8fec10fb4fce2b99dfbeec1f319e3e16df6f29a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/287d7a70f7c61eeb63511a120b212d524d4b7779","verification":{"payload":"tree 8fec10fb4fce2b99dfbeec1f319e3e16df6f29a9\nparent 26c2eb805e26e6828284b91653fe30fbf075751a\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1790715396 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790715396 +0200\n\nchore(hooks): one light hook layer + in-tree tool caches + CI lint caches (#459)\n\n* chore(ci): light git hooks, in-tree tool caches, CI lint caches (WR-1785)\n\nHooks move to the ADR-0028 Amendment 2 shape and the root .githooks/ becomes\nthe only hook layer. CaptainHook (captainhook.json + both packages) and the\nfrontend/.husky/ scripts are removed.\n\n- pre-commit: pint writes and re-stages the staged PHP; a file with unstaged\n  edits gets pint --test only. Frontend keeps the registry regeneration and\n  lint-staged, now with --concurrent false and a worktree-private backup\n  instead of lint-staged''s refs/stash backup.\n- pre-push: range touches backend/ -> phpstan, phpstan:types, composer audit;\n  frontend/ outside *.md -> vue-tsc. No stdin runs every gate. Pest, Rector,\n  Deptrac, Vitest, knip and the build are CI only.\n- Pint cache-file, PHPStan tmpDir (one per config) in storage/, git-ignored;\n  pint:test runs --parallel.\n- backend-ci lint job restores/saves the Pint, Rector (PR restore, push save)\n  and PHPStan caches, keyed on config + composer.lock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012rp6fJpPHeUVX7WhPRG37S\n\n* fix(hooks): hand Pint only the staged files its own finder formats\n\nPint formats every path it is handed and skips its finder, so the pre-commit\nrewrote staged *.blade.php files (two are tracked here) and anything else\nPint excludes (_ide_helper*.php, storage/, pint.json exclude/notPath/notName).\nThe hook now asks Pint''s finder, loaded from the installed phar, which staged\nfiles it formats (the same intersection `pint --dirty` makes) and fails loudly\nif that probe fails or finds nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012rp6fJpPHeUVX7WhPRG37S\n\n* fix(hooks): refuse a partially staged frontend file before lint-staged runs\n\n`--no-stash` implies `--no-hide-partially-staged`, so lint-staged''s tasks\nwrote the whole working-tree file and re-added it, unstaged hunks included.\nThe frontend now refuses such a file, as the backend already refuses to let\npint write one. Teeth-proved: a partially staged .ts exits 1 with the file\nnamed; the same file fully staged passes the new check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PyoWBg8kexGpWQ4yhR5Fch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvCYECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfowQACkseXtrCi3eXD9N5y4Pvwe2\nqgOfZ9gFP6+XFuF6B1aNW5GQzdwZpWGITud88bchyLIRtVtQlcc5nBixdgjPZ1R+\nN6/9FriCXWdE6jdv7Shkwn+/7hyLQVRgnYwaHbf4iUktUs3vBlyVwLMU9luaF4wZ\nHktrZqR6fbk7asSh8m37TovQDoHKNKsI5U5ev/ZCCMg0NieIERNNsWk2JlcRkITb\nYessws52ATu8nOCRFWJSfHHvmN4uzSlJc30Mx9WT/RAyvYnLeQ+p+iGYrro9D+6N\nfCrmBEFSJM88TmUraDSc8kRSrS519VXkTUn1ZHEteS8L70ine0j2o6OALWVCEi+y\n90d+7G9zQnJULs1CS3azTUuk37HL6Uwg5Drd5ZxthXiC0KYrqgMM6CR79KDbIJwp\nExQ5xwao8eaT9/Iq+/S6eU+8uKURiIbhrM0+/G6n6C31Xswj8s9Ye3