vatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24678549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Goosterhof","id":24678549,"login":"Goosterhof","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Njc4NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goosterhof","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/commits/e69a8335790cfa11056b5d62a4d973a052780a9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:23:53Z","email":"gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com","name":"Gerard Oosterhof"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:23:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): adopt phpstan-warroom-rules ^0.10 — ForbidCredentialCastBypassRule parser fix (WR-1462) (#444)\n\nv0.9.0 ran the credential-cast rule inert in every consumer: the model cast\nmap was read through a body-stripping parser for any file outside the\nanalysed set, so a query-builder write of a hashed/encrypted column reported\nnothing. v0.10.0 wires @currentPhpVersionRichParser (pwr #75/#76). The caret\n^0.9 excludes it, hence the pin bump.\n\nPositive control on this head (phpstan 2.2.14): a planted\nUser::query()->where(''id'', 1)->update([''password'' => ''plaintext'']) against\nthe real User model (''password'' => ''hashed'') reports\nforbidCredentialCastBypass.castBypassedByBuilderWrite on a WARM run (the\nshape that was silent on v0.9.0) and on a COLD run after clear-result-cache.\nProbe removed; cold full gate 0 errors.\n\nCommitted with --no-verify: the CaptainHook gauntlet cannot run from a\nsubmodule checkout (WR-0864, pulse 2026-08-27 — dirname() on the gitdir).\nAll five actions run by hand on this tree instead: lint:test (pint + rector)\npassed, phpstan cold 0 errors, phpstan:types 0 errors, deptrac 0 violations,\ntest:arch 115 passed / 2040 assertions. CI authoritative.\n\nWar-room WR-1475.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"507fe3a324d42222798d83317f6ccf481425eb3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/507fe3a324d42222798d83317f6ccf481425eb3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/e69a8335790cfa11056b5d62a4d973a052780a9e","verification":{"payload":"tree 507fe3a324d42222798d83317f6ccf481425eb3d\nparent f4596f94fb6d7b7fae010dfaed5c5d3b18888ab4\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1789989833 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789989833 +0200\n\nchore(deps): adopt phpstan-warroom-rules ^0.10 — ForbidCredentialCastBypassRule parser fix (WR-1462) (#444)\n\nv0.9.0 ran the credential-cast rule inert in every consumer: the model cast\nmap was read through a body-stripping parser for any file outside the\nanalysed set, so a query-builder write of a hashed/encrypted column reported\nnothing. v0.10.0 wires @currentPhpVersionRichParser (pwr #75/#76). The caret\n^0.9 excludes it, hence the pin bump.\n\nPositive control on this head (phpstan 2.2.14): a planted\nUser::query()->where(''id'', 1)->update([''password'' => ''plaintext'']) against\nthe real User model (''password'' => ''hashed'') reports\nforbidCredentialCastBypass.castBypassedByBuilderWrite on a WARM run (the\nshape that was silent on v0.9.0) and on a COLD run after clear-result-cache.\nProbe removed; cold full gate 0 errors.\n\nCommitted with --no-verify: the CaptainHook gauntlet cannot run from a\nsubmodule checkout (WR-0864, pulse 2026-08-27 — dirname() on the gitdir).\nAll five actions run by hand on this tree instead: lint:test (pint + rector)\npassed, phpstan cold 0 errors, phpstan:types 0 errors, deptrac 0 violations,\ntest:arch 115 passed / 2040 assertions. CI authoritative.\n\nWar-room WR-1475.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsRPJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm5UQAIzdN8P3OsvNa+RO6cgHRlVx\n+H+QhW3UCT8y6a6GIJFtg+0beNOjRR5Ke8saYcGSU8PADEGhfwr8nyArCMo17QXq\nlmr273NNdn7jRZ5pQ1eybs2YRQvHwLsn2OTZ7JIHBk6Nll2ZNiXdbPpWGF/VMp76\nJVWO2X/D+Yj/Ij8dHNDxGGlcF7JO6hMjnDL4siHZ1mLobOOAPzyuZyQZ+5cZ6/Rk\nFWJbyL3zLmILhtnqiAA/LQlP0LBnGZQQr4Pa0ZrjJNVNiVHqxeHw5h8T+pltTYQy\nb1SXt0pHcz6xAVf0as0x+V4Drc12HZaMrMvdmsyNhnFYsULgoRf4Em8i3Q0r0vtp\nTaeMJhWd3lGWoixnd4Fw2urnzJ875ZsfOxTZdetu7BtIKo/JJdkALG2V7zfyrGBo\nHH5W5HiEyOigpWTPlSIWfPLAitcdLAzFJEMB5pN6u50I4RwEKVRrZhg2xpXTHWt1\n3TBcZyRg00MXMnTG2pLzNNvYRjATNEbvbweRmOH7GvvdSqx0znYMD9ubtqKeXSjs\nTTDuolnU0lL0CiSKzbcYdt4+gXjyB0GkF4Z1kfziF+J9k+RUk/QEK5gWd5obpAOd\nnL6Qt3fD8PYtUz7sdcymsrNDXYmll4xV0g/WmNgVAzq27taRUMmYuYUOfwTqINnq\nAlFFSQsXYuTAJ5VIgaO3\n=syRR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T11:23:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl