-runner@10 peers core@10)\n  size-limit                     ^12.0.0 -> ^13.0.3\n  @size-limit/file               ^12.0.0 -> ^13.0.3  (file@13 peers size-limit@13)\n\nKept as one commit because both pairs rewrite frontend/package-lock.json;\nlanding them as separate PRs would conflict on merge regardless of order.\n\nNeither major needed a config change. Verified with the frontend gate''s own\ncommands (.github/workflows/frontend*.yml), not bare tool invocations:\n\n  lint · lint:vue · knip · format:check · type-check   all pass\n  test:coverage        100% stmts/branch/funcs/lines (1469/1076/438/1365)\n  test:integration:run 20 files, 150 tests passed\n  test:mutation        96.00% (239 killed, 1 timeout, 10 survived, 0 errors)\n                       above the 90 break threshold; per-file floor passes\n                       across all 9 mutated files\n  build                succeeds\n  size                 families 141.89 kB / 350 kB, admin 30.88 kB / 150 kB\n\nnpm audit reports one pre-existing high-severity brace-expansion advisory.\nIt is present identically on origin/main and is not introduced by this bump.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HJ7AobcmickSXLybYoAcra\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"903b182f021cb239d1c23ee4444214b9c81022ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/trees/903b182f021cb239d1c23ee4444214b9c81022ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goosterhof/brick-inventory-orchestrator/git/commits/b2eaf15fbf98fa854c7b3ddca060d08cefd75e85","verification":{"payload":"tree 903b182f021cb239d1c23ee4444214b9c81022ac\nparent 598a43c1aaa36d9cf97c149bdd63a3927e51a25c\nauthor Gerard Oosterhof <gerard.oosterhof@gmail.com> 1787819886 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787819886 +0200\n\nchore(deps-dev): bump stryker to 10 and size-limit to 13 as peer-locked pairs (#394)\n\nDependabot raised these as three separate PRs (#392, #352, #351),