nd support using Turborepo''s\nbuilt-in microfrontends feature. Configure multiple applications (web, vite, docs,\napi) composed through a unified proxy.\n\n**Applications:**\n- apps/web: Next.js app (port 3000) - Main application\n- apps/vite: Vite + React app (port 3002) - Admin dashboard\n- apps/docs: Next.js app (port 3001) - Documentation\n- apps/api: Hono/Bun API server (port 3003) - Backend API\n\n**Microfrontends Setup:**\n- Proxy runs on port 3024 composing all apps\n- Route-based path matching for app selection\n- Shared session cookie for authentication across apps\n- Dynamic port assignment via turbo get-mfe-port\n\n**Features:**\n- Shared TypeScript configurations\n- Shared ESLint configurations\n- Shared UI component library (@repo/ui)\n- Shared constants package (@repo/constants)\n- Optimized builds with Turborepo caching\n\n**Documentation:**\n- CLAUDE.md: Repository overview for Claude Code\n- Microfrontend architecture guide\n- Development commands reference\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: GLM <service@zhipuai.cn>","tree":{"sha":"29d63b2cbcdac7863c143586952c13c5d6df338b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/trees/29d63b2cbcdac7863c143586952c13c5d6df338b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/commits/50f5c68bdf63e9aad85b51178441c4e93fcf59dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 29d63b2cbcdac7863c143586952c13c5d6df338b\nparent e7a2a2e0391eaea1001a30d925597ca9bb8b806c\nauthor ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048674 +0800\ncommitter ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048674 +0800\n\nchore(repo): initialize monorepo with microfrontend architecture\n\nInitialize Turborepo monorepo with microfrontend support using Turborepo''s\nbuilt-in microfrontends feature. Configure multiple applications (web, vite, docs,\napi) composed through a unified proxy.\n\n**Applications:**\n- apps/web: Next.js app (port 3000) - Main application\n- apps/vite: Vite + React app (port 3002) - Admin dashboard\n- apps/docs: Next.js app (port 3001) - Documentation\n- apps/api: Hono/Bun API server (port 3003) - Backend API\n\n**Microfrontends Setup:**\n- Proxy runs on port 3024 composing all apps\n- Route-based path matching for app selection\n- Shared session cookie for authentication across apps\n- Dynamic port assignment via turbo get-mfe-port\n\n**Features:**\n- Shared TypeScript configurations\n- Shared ESLint configurations\n- Shared UI component library (@repo/ui)\n- Shared constants package (@repo/constants)\n- Optimized builds with Turborepo caching\n\n**Documentation:**\n- CLAUDE.md: Repository overview for Claude Code\n- Microfrontend architecture guide\n- Development commands reference\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: GLM <service@zhipuai.cn>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgwNrbWnPozrruZk7nNfQBjgFweu\n2Ck2y3pjaQwR5J068AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFr28SdmKbbBP2NE65ej/ObBtZ0V5wbBjbhqTcacPXq51XEvsm4X737g6knprgmc9Z\nETO3YMeFp/5XJ2riiKUww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-02T16:16:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43884159?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ededddy","id":43884159,"login":"ededddy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg0MTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/starred{/own