uai.cn>","tree":{"sha":"63aadec7178995abd0ad6fac2f038713448430a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/trees/63aadec7178995abd0ad6fac2f038713448430a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/commits/8bdabb3b4fbd7a69c7cd5705e127f4a33ca0cd59","verification":{"payload":"tree 63aadec7178995abd0ad6fac2f038713448430a0\nparent 78c2927647c566845e87008fa86466b9e58c9505\nauthor ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048572 +0800\ncommitter ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048572 +0800\n\nfeat(web): implement authentication pages and middleware\n\nAdd login and signup pages with Neo-Brutalist styling and implement\nserver-side route protection using middleware.\n\n**Authentication Pages:**\n- Create login page with email/password form\n- Create signup page with registration form\n- Implement form validation and error handling\n- Add redirect on successful authentication\n\n**Middleware:**\n- Implement middleware.ts for server-side route protection\n- Validate session tokens before allowing access to protected routes\n- Redirect unauthenticated users to login page\n\n**Styling:**\n- Apply Neo-Brutalist design system to auth pages\n- Use sharp borders, bold typography, and high contrast colors\n- Add responsive layouts for mobile and desktop\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: GLM <service@zhipuai.cn>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgwNrbWnPozrruZk7nNfQBjgFweu\n2Ck2y3pjaQwR5J068AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBUc3H4thTpsFlLSRGrHLAjA68qetq1xGMvmkVg1dCTf1RRJhNvmEPzHEt7NNgUMYR\nyb6HhrcofCLFvkmvRafw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-02T16:16:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43884159?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use