pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/commits/78c2927647c566845e87008fa86466b9e58c9505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T16:09:26Z","email":"eddylei070300@gmail.com","name":"ededddy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T16:09:26Z","email":"eddylei070300@gmail.com","name":"ededddy"},"message":"feat(web): add authentication system and Neo-Brutalist design\n\nImplement authentication flow with better-auth and create comprehensive\nNeo-Brutalist design system for the web application.\n\n**Authentication System:**\n- Create better-auth client configuration with Next.js cookies plugin\n- Implement middleware for server-side route protection\n- Add session validation for protected routes\n\n**Design System:**\n- Create globals.css with Neo-Brutalist CSS variables (colors, typography, spacing)\n- Define custom properties for sharp-edged aesthetic\n- Add utility classes for common patterns (container, grid, flex)\n- Configure font variables (Syne for display, IBM Plex Mono for code)\n\n**Shared Components:**\n- Create GradientBackground component with animated geometric patterns\n- Create AuthHeader component with authentication-aware navigation\n- Add responsive design with mobile menu support\n- Implement user menu with dropdown navigation\n\n**Fonts & Typography:**\n- Add Google Fonts: Syne (display) and IBM Plex Mono (monospace)\n- Configure Next.js font optimization with next/font/google\n- Add local font files for fallback support\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: GLM <service@zhipuai.cn>","tree":{"sha":"3a07041d4a705c784f0b4fedf0ea181a41d451db","url":"http