://api.github.com/users/ededddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ededddy","id":43884159,"login":"ededddy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg0MTU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ededddy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/commits/66835cafa9a181f695750b551cbc631105ad3788/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T16:09:14Z","email":"eddylei070300@gmail.com","name":"ededddy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T16:09:14Z","email":"eddylei070300@gmail.com","name":"ededddy"},"message":"feat(vite): migrate dashboard from Next.js to Vite SPA\n\nPort the protected dashboard page from Next.js to Vite, adapting patterns\nto React Router v7 while maintaining the Neo-Brutalist design system.\n\n**Authentication & Route Protection:**\n- Create auth client without nextCookies plugin (client-side only)\n- Add ProtectedRoute wrapper with cross-app redirect to login\n- Configure VITE_AUTH_URL and VITE_PROXY_URL for proxy routing\n\n**Component Migration:**\n- Port GradientBackground (animated geometric patterns)\n- Port AuthHeader (useRouter → useNavigate, Link href→to props)\n- Port Dashboard page (remove ''use client'', update navigation)\n- Copy CSS modules maintaining design consistency\n\n**Routing Architecture:**\n- Implement data router (createBrowserRouter) for useNavigation support\n- Create RootLayout component for global layout elements\n- Configure protected routes with ProtectedRoute wrapper\n- Add redirects for /admin → /admin/dashboard\n\n**Design System:**\n- Replace index.css with Neo-Brutalist CSS variables\n- Add Google Fonts (Syne, IBM Plex Mono) to index.html\n- Maintain sharp-edged aesthetic with custom properties\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: GLM <service@zhipuai.cn>","tree":{"sha":"966b07e4c05fe7b609eb5b1ccf9f06694c42cdb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/trees/966b07e4c05fe7b609eb5b1ccf9f06694c42cdb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ededddy/turborepo-mfe-test/git/commits/66835cafa9a181f695750b551cbc631105ad3788","verification":{"payload":"tree 966b07e4c05fe7b609eb5b1ccf9f06694c42cdb2\nparent 5c66c4e74a71ba45d28ca7846020acb9808c0e65\nauthor ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048554 +0800\ncommitter ededddy <eddylei070300@gmail.com> 1770048554 +0800\n\nfeat(vite): migrate dashboard from Next.js to Vite SPA\n\nPort the protected dashboard page from Next.js to Vite, adapting patterns\nto React Router v7 while maintaining the Neo-Brutalist design system.\n\n**Authentication & Route Protection:**\n- Create auth client without nextCookies plugin (client-side only)\n- Add ProtectedRoute wrapper with cross-app redirect to login\n- Configure VITE_AUTH_URL and VITE_PROXY_URL for proxy routing\n\n**Component Migration:**\n- Port GradientBackground (animated geometric patterns)\n- Port AuthHeader (useRouter → useNavigate, Link href→to props)\n- Port Dashboard page (remove ''use client'', update navigation)\n- Copy CSS modules maintaining design consistency\n\n**Routing Architecture:**\n- Implement data router (createBrowserRouter) for useNavigation support\n- Create RootLayout component for global layout elements\n- Configure protected routes with ProtectedRoute wrapper\n- Add redirects for /admin → /admin/dashboard\n\n**Design System:**\n- Replace index.css with Neo-Brutalist CSS variables\n- Add Google Fonts (Syne, IBM Plex Mono) to index.html\n- Maintain sharp-edged aesthetic with custom properties\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/