ntegration:\n- Add \"normalize\" to VersionStep type\n- applyNormalization() creates a new version with step=\"normalize\",\n  updates assembledContent/finalContent/activeVersionId on accepted\n  chronicles — original content preserved in version history\n\nBulk Actions tab:\n- \"Normalize Markdown\" section under Content phase\n- Checkboxes for stories/documents\n- Runs normalizer on all selected completed chronicles\n- Shows changed/total count on completion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4147346c8fd570c60102ba95e481c44910b48b87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/4147346c8fd570c60102ba95e481c44910b48b87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/2ea24e9971051d06abedd4e9486e0b9ccaeb60fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/2ea24e9971051d06abedd4e9486e0b9ccaeb60fe","node_id":"C_kwDORHOrMtoAKDJlYTI0ZTk5NzEwNTFkMDZhYmVkZDRlOTQ4NmUwYjljY2FlYjYwZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/9409dfccc2cca7cd991665c287230d065a616fb1","sha":"9409dfccc2cca7cd991665c287230d065a616fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/9409dfccc2cca7cd991665c287230d065a616fb1"}],"sha":"2ea24e9971051d06abedd4e9486e0b9ccaeb60fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/2ea24e9971051d06abedd4e9486e0b9ccaeb60fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/9409dfccc2cca7cd991665c287230d065a616fb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T15:08:16Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T15:08:16Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"revert: remove finalize editor, layout editor, and chronicle-renderer package\n\nBoth the TipTap WYSIWYG finalize editor and the visual layout editor\noverlay were insufficient for the spatial layout editing required.\nRemove all related code:\n\nDeleted:\n- packages/chronicle-renderer/ (shared package, only existed for finalize editor)\n- FinalizeEditor, FinalizeView, tiptapExtensions (illuminator)\n- LayoutEditor overlay (chronicler)\n- finalizedPageRepository, finalizedPageStorage\n- renderToHtml, chronicleToHtml\n- Dexie v13 (finalizedPages table)\n- TipTap dependencies (@tiptap/react, starter-kit, extensions)\n- ElementOverride type from PageLayoutOverride\n\nRestored to state at 3ec635c5 (global footnote numbering fix):\n- wikiBuilderChronicle.ts (original, no shared package import)\n- WikiPage.tsx, WikiExplorer.tsx, WikiPageSections.tsx\n- useWikiExplorerData.ts, pageLayoutStorage.ts\n- prePrintTypes.ts, illuminatorDb.ts, PrePrintPanel.tsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a54988a92e7175764f4566a0bfaa99fd0feba4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/a54988a92e7175764f4566a0bfaa99fd0feba4c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/9409dfccc2cca7cd991665c287230d065a616fb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use