comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:55:47Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"feat: visual layout editor for per-element overrides in chronicler\n\nAdd an \"Edit Layout\" toggle on chronicle pages in the chronicler.\nWhen active, images and annotations become clickable — selecting one\nshows a floating control panel to adjust size, justification, and\nmargins. Overrides are stored per-element in the PageLayoutOverride\nrecord and applied during the normal render pass.\n\nData model:\n- Add ElementOverride type (size, justification, marginTop/Bottom,\n  display) to PageLayoutOverride in both illuminator and chronicler\n- Add putPageLayout write function to chronicler''s pageLayoutStorage\n\nLayoutEditor component:\n- Click-to-select on images and annotations via event delegation\n- Floating panel with size/justify/margin controls\n- Saves immediately to pageLayouts table\n- layout-editing CSS class highlights hoverable elements\n\nRender integration:\n- applyImageOverride() swaps size/justification from element overrides\n- overrideMarginStyle() applies margin adjustments as inline styles\n- Applied in flow mode fragment renderer\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7896ad9355ed2a696b1a92bbfd89e2fe6eea9345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/7896ad9355ed2a696b1a92bbfd89e2fe6eea9345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/812f9f2af77e0d977824deb9ce1058fd735a0d52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https