eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/094670aaeee3895edb9b5097f1490aa31aeb5f88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:34:21Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:34:21Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"fix: finalize editor scrollbar, image layout, and historian annotations\n\n- Add scrollable wrapper div around TipTap EditorContent\n- Create custom TipTap extensions: ChronicleImage (preserves size,\n  justification, data-image-id), HistorianNote (aside blocks),\n  NoteLabel (inline note type labels)\n- Images render with size classes (small/medium/large/full-width) and\n  float left/right matching the chronicler''s layout\n- Cover image gets cover-image class with max-height and object-fit\n- renderToHtml outputs plain <img> with layout classes instead of\n  <figure> wrappers that TipTap would strip\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01e5d592170b6dd8307689d5bcd2408c28a8d404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/01e5d592170b6dd8307689d5bcd2408c28a8d404"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/094670aaeee3895edb9b5097f1490aa31aeb5f88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/094670aaeee3895edb9b5097f1490aa31aeb5f88","node_id":"C_kwDORHOrMtoAKDA5NDY3MGFhZWVlMzg5NWVkYjliNTA5N2YxNDkwYWEzMWFlYjVmODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8","sha":"b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8"}],"sha":"094670aaeee3895edb9b5097f1490aa31aeb5f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/094670aaeee3895edb9b5097f1490aa31aeb5f88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:49:38Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:49:38Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"feat: shared chronicle-renderer package, finalize editor uses same pipeline\n\nExtract the core chronicle rendering pipeline (section parsing, image\nattachment, historian note resolution, fuzzy anchor matching) into\n@the-canonry/chronicle-renderer shared package. Both the chronicler\nand illuminator import from it — single source of truth, no duplication.\n\nchronicle-renderer package:\n- buildChronicleRender(): sections + images + notes from raw content\n- attachImagesToSections(): anchor-based image placement\n- resolveHistorianNotes(): display mode filtering\n- resolveAnchorPhrase(): fuzzy anchor matching (extracted from both apps)\n- Shared types: WikiSection, WikiSectionImage, ChronicleImageRef, etc.\n\nChronicler migration:\n- wikiBuilderChronicle.ts now imports from @the-canonry/chronicle-renderer\n  for section building, keeps only chronicler-specific concerns (wiki\n  linking, slug generation, page assembly)\n- Removed \"Send to Editor\" workflow — no longer needed\n\nIlluminator finalize editor:\n- Uses buildChronicleRender() from shared package for initial content\n- renderToHtml.ts serializes the shared render output to HTML with\n  resolved image URLs from IndexedDB\n- Reset button re-renders from source through the same shared pipeline\n- Deleted duplicate chronicleToHtml.ts renderer\n- Lazy-loaded FinalizeView to prevent TipTap from blocking MFE init\n- Fixed TextStyle named export\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60016e1c64d1fb061ee07ae2c29002d3e173a733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/60016e1c64d1fb061ee07ae2c29002d3e173a733"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8","node_id":"C_kwDORHOrMtoAKGI5ZmY2ZjFlZDVmMTE1OTYxNTQ4M2FmNmY3MzEyOTQ2MzA5YmIzZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/695328936110312bfff9e0ba42a254e8f755d949","sha":"695328936110312bfff9e0ba42a254e8f755d949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/695328936110312bfff9e0ba42a254e8f755d949"}],"sha":"b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/b9ff6f1ed5f1159615483af6f7312946309bb3f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/695328936110312bfff9e0ba42a254e8f755d949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:12:58Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:12:58Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"feat: add WYSIWYG finalize editor for per-chronicle layout control\n\nAdds a TipTap-based rich text editor in Illuminator''s PrePrint panel\nfor finalizing chronicle layouts. Finalized pages are stored as a\nseparate entity (finalizedPages Dexie table, v13) — source chronicles\nare never modified.\n\nIlluminator:\n- Install @tiptap/react, starter-kit, extension-image, text-align,\n  text-style\n- Add finalizedPages table (v13) with repository CRUD\n- chronicleToHtml renderer: converts chronicle record to semantic HTML\n  with images (data-image-id), historian notes (aside blocks), and\n  inline markdown formatting\n- FinalizeEditor: TipTap editor with toolbar (bold, italic, headings,\n  alignment, hr, blockquote), auto-save to IndexedDB (1s debounce),\n  reset-to-source button\n- FinalizeView: chronicle selector sidebar + editor area, added as\n  Finalize sub-tab in PrePrintPanel\n\nChronicler:\n- finalizedPageStorage.ts reads from the shared Illuminator DB\n- useWikiExplorerData loads finalized pages alongside layouts\n- WikiPageView renders finalizedHtml directly when present, bypassing\n  the normal section build pipeline\n- Fix margin mode: positioned margin items with ResizeObserver for\n  image load re-layout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0f7a12e70f4c697e629266e77d9f4a7861af4e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/c0f7a12e70f4c697e629266e77d9f4a7861af4e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/695328936110312bfff9e0ba42a254e8f755d949","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-