arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/3ec635c5a545832d9059af691fd996a1d4b58e83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:58:06Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:58:06Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"fix: global footnote numbering across multi-section chronicles\n\nFootnote numbers were resetting to 1 at each section boundary because\neach SectionWithImages independently resolved notes against its own\ncontent. Now resolveGlobalFootnotes() runs once at the page level,\nresolving all notes against concatenated section content and assigning\nglobally consistent indices. Per-section resolved entries (with local\noffsets and global indices) are passed down to each section, which\ninjects superscripts using the pre-computed data instead of\nre-resolving.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd724d9ff337a29d0b1364a451f3e16068114e04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/fd724d9ff337a29d0b1364a451f3e16068114e04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/3ec635c5a545832d9059af691fd996a1d4b58e83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","grav