s-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commits/e93b5c2aed8891ec96b6c0ea393cf221a38d0221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:50:17Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:50:17Z","email":"carsena2@gmail.com","name":"Chris Arsenault"},"message":"feat: lazy image loading, curation complete, chronicler layout overrides, viewer prefs\n\nIlluminator:\n- Refactor ThumbnailStrip to accept imageIds and lazily load blobs via\n  IntersectionObserver + useImageUrl (fixes 20s lag on image tabs)\n- Remove batch blob loading from CurationImageSheet and EntityImageSheet\n- Add curationComplete flag to chronicle/entity data layer with toggle UI\n- Show complete checkmark in CurationNavigator and EntityCurationNavigator\n- Replace dropcap checkbox with 3-way radio (Auto/On/Off) using string type\n- Delete unused PageLayoutEditor component\n\nChronicler:\n- Fix era narrative appearing under Stories in ChronicleIndex\n- Add per-chronicle Refresh button (reloads from Dexie with updated image\n  refs and layout options)\n- Wire up layoutOverride from Illuminator pageLayouts table (was defined\n  but never passed to WikiPageView)\n- Fix footnote numbering in flow mode: use pre-resolved positions instead\n  of re-resolving anchors per fragment\n- Implement annotation position overrides (sidenote/inline/footnote) with\n  CSS data-attribute driven display\n- Fix narrow-screen callout rendering: inline-at-anchor callouts replace\n  broken top-of-section dump; margin mode fallback for collapsed grids\n- Add viewer preferences flyout (localStorage) for annotations, note\n  position, and image visibility with viewer > override > default precedence\n- Hide decorative scrollwork SVG on mobile viewports\n- Remove table of contents from chronicle/document pages (entities only)\n- Cover hero image: natural aspect with max-height 50vh instead of fixed\n  400px crop; gradient overlay pointer-events:none for lightbox clicks\n- Gate all dropcap CSS on [data-dropcap] attribute (hr+p rule was firing\n  unconditionally)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55417e4d33f8e5279f578c996cafd077ea7d74d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/55417e4d33f8e5279f578c996cafd077ea7d74d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/e93b5c2aed8891ec96b6c0ea393cf221a38d0221","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/e93b