ion, catalog similarity, pics gallery overhaul\n\nIlluminator: extract bulk actions into dedicated module, add entity curation\npanel, catalog similarity analysis, image workspace for preprint, style pills,\nthumbnail strip, sidebar navigation overhaul, coverage report expansion,\nLLM fill enhancements, image style assignment logic, entity bulk image ops.\n\nCanonry: AWS sync modal improvements, upload callback refactor.\n\nPics: gallery state management, about page, filter bar redesign, lightbox\nand masonry grid improvements, HQ image support.\n\nGeneral: ESLint config updates, new planning docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f78e895ad7bde4d469d7fb9872c3752ced40c0b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/f78e895ad7bde4d469d7fb9872c3752ced40c0b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/b60236f62e487f0f31307af7b71e5dc12b0e0c9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","t