ction in test panel\n- Chronicle bulk operations and API key handling updates\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Consolidated terraform-pics into terraform-viewer/pics.tf\n- Updated deploy scripts and outputs for multi-site support\n\nCanonry:\n- Catalog builder: grouped facets with category sorting\n- Removed legacy App.jsx and TagRegistryEditor.jsx\n\nWorld schema:\n- Color palette and composition style definition updates\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fefcab19ce626ca753588ab0a56bcb05727c0863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/fefcab19ce626ca753588ab0a56bcb05727c0863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/f96fa59c87d3fe3e6a5c28770bbc6d6ede072ceb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/f96fa59c87d3fe3e6a5c28770bbc6d6ed