 terraform-pics/ module deploys the pics gallery app with:\n- S3 bucket for static content (React SPA)\n- CloudFront distribution serving app shell + shared image bucket\n- ACM certificate and Route53 DNS for pics.theiceremembers.com\n- Cache invalidation on deploy\n\nAlso extends viewer terraform with additional_image_distribution_arns\nvariable to allow the pics distribution to read from the shared image bucket.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67a40c00924014ad8af923ad2e0f90b7249c38da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/67a40c00924014ad8af923ad2e0f90b7249c38da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/1cbd1417e05e09c57d4bbd1e842d80ef2ffe361c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/1cbd1417e05e09c57d4bbd1e842d80