, and era narrative scans\nreturned zero matches — only entity results appeared.\n\nNow handleScan ensures the chronicle store is initialized (reading\nsimulationRunId from the config store) before scanning, and reads\nnavItems fresh from the store rather than the stale render closure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"737422c4e8cad16c49631d43dd9e05367ddb89f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/737422c4e8cad16c49631d43dd9e05367ddb89f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/ff52ccd913d93ba64fb1f5c59f964395bdb36a51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/commit/ff52ccd913d93ba64fb1f5c59f964395bdb36a51","node_id":"C_kwDORHOrMtoAKGZmNTJjY2Q5MTNkOTNiYTY0ZmIxZjVjNTlmOTY0Mzk1YmRiMzZhNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://githu