rate all 8 image display sites across chronicler and archivist.\n\n- Add AlternateGroup/ImageVersion types and getAlternates to image-store\n- CDN backend indexes bundle alternates for version cycling\n- useImageAlternates hook with cache-first lookup\n- ImageDisplay component with enableVersionCycling prop\n- Migrate chronicler: WikiPageImages, WikiExplorerHome,\n  WikiPageInfobox, WikiPagePreview, WikiPage\n- Migrate archivist: EntityDetail\n- Clean up dead hoveredImageUrl/infoboxImageUrl from return values\n- Convert chronicler CSS modules to global CSS\n- Illuminator: bulk operations, chronicle workspace, entity browser,\n  image settings, wavespeed integration, and other accumulated changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"274b160cb17b48d35d136611d58aece58d94a027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/274b160cb17b48d35d136611d58aece58d94a027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/4b8ca88249039e06066854e4f056f6a38592f9c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{