omatic pattern\nfor passing dynamic values to CSS classes.\n\nExtracted inline styles across 154 files in 8 apps: created ~111 new\ncompanion CSS files with component-scoped class prefixes. Static styles\nbecome CSS classes; dynamic values use CSS custom properties set via\nstyle={{ ''--foo'': expr }} with var(--foo) in CSS. Deleted const styles\nobjects and unused theme imports throughout.\n\nAlso includes prior drift pipeline work: BulkOperationShell extraction,\nCSS theming alignment, ErrorBoundary at MFE boundaries, shared-component\nadoption for archivist/chronicler, zustand stores for canonry UI state,\nand federation shared deps updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec10e3b2aa820fb6bdd7ab566193841d05ac748c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/trees/ec10e3b2aa820fb6bdd7ab566193841d05ac748c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chris-arsenault/the-canonry/git/commits/213f41272448f7d54facf3a65d3570374624934f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5192503?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chris-arsenault","id":5192503,"login":"chris-arsenault","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTI1MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chris-arsenault/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git