,"email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T05:09:27Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"fix: heatmap global coverage and small-box bug at low zoom\n\n- SpatialTileCache: add getNearestWider() — only searches same/wider zoom\n  levels (prevents city-level data appearing as tiny box at low zoom)\n- AQIHeatmapLayer: clamp getBounds().pad() to [-85.05,85.05] lat & [-180,180] lng\n  to prevent invalid coordinates at very low zoom in API calls\n- AQIHeatmapLayer: zoom-dependent padding (0 at z≤4, 0.25x at z5-7, 0.5x at z8+)\n  to avoid overflow at near-global zoom levels\n- AQIHeatmapLayer: fallback cascade now uses getNearestWider only — removes\n  getNearestZoom and getAnyOverlapping which could return high-zoom/narrow-bbox\n  data that rendered as a small rectangular box when zoomed out\n- AQIHeatmapLayer: viewportCovered() clamps comparison to valid range\n- Grid resolution: 8-14 points (was 6-12) for smoother low-zoom coverage","tree":{"sha":"74ee78c491578d35eecc7fff88947a18f086e3e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/74ee78c491578d35eecc7fff88947a18f086e3e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/7f271386a1488ac1d3351d70fa825abba06aea43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/