pe":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/commits/e85f06fa1d2dc80a24ea3f9a81c70aa000d0433c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T04:51:51Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T04:53:47Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"perf: zero-delay camera move — atomic swap, viewport padding, leading throttle, prefetch, mip-map\n\n- SpatialTileCache: 4x larger quantization grid, getNearestZoom mip-map,\n  getAnyOverlapping scan, viewport-contains check, bbox stored per entry\n- RoadPollutionLayer: atomic swap (old stays until new ready), pad(0.5)\n  over-fetch, leading throttle 500ms, prefetch 4 adjacent tiles on idle,\n  viewportCovered check skips fetch when data still covers screen\n- AQIHeatmapLayer: persistent canvas reuse, setUrl/setBounds atomic update,\n  leading throttle, pad(0.5), mip-map fallback, old overlay kept visible\n- road-aqi.ts: edge cache s-maxage=900 swr=3600, zoom-dependent coarse\n  Redis key quantization (~2km grid), maxSpan doubled for padded viewports\n- grid-aqi.ts: edge cache s-maxage=1800 swr=3600, 2-degree Redis key grid\n- vercel.json: cron keep-warm every 5min for road-aqi (eliminates cold start)","tree":{"sha":"bc4c3ab121e1a905d4fd235ec54ca9c37c8dcea3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/bc4c3ab121e1a905d4fd235ec54ca9c37c8dcea3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/e85f06fa1d2dc80a24ea3f9a81c70aa000d0433c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_u