back with proper raster visualization\n\n2. Canvas renderer for WebGL-like road performance:\n   - Shared L.canvas() renderer for all road polylines\n   - Handles 2000+ polylines at 60fps (vs SVG ~500)\n   - Road limits increased: z16=2000, z15=1200, z14=800, z13=600\n\n3. Sentinel-5P TROPOMI NO₂ satellite integration:\n   - New api/vayu/satellite.ts: Copernicus Data Space Processing API\n   - OAuth2 auth with CDSE, S5P L2 NO₂ evalscript, 12h Redis cache\n   - Spatial correction factor [0.7-1.5] in road-aqi.ts baseline\n   - Fetched in parallel with WAQI bias for zero added latency\n   - Graceful degradation when credentials not configured\n   - UI: S5P indicator badge in MapLayersSheet status bar\n\nFiles: 3 new + 5 modified","tree":{"sha":"bcbcac1b519ba1b16014e4252073d50a9504704d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/bcbcac1b519ba1b16014e4252073d50a9504704d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/e5310c4c76752cd2e65ef71df0caaedb5efdb3fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https