com","name":"Tristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T02:19:51Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"feat(vayu): Phase 5 — Concentration/AQI mode, OSPM canyon, weather panel\n\n- MapLayersSheet: eLichens-style mode header (Concentration vs AQI label)\n- Legend: mode-specific scale labels (Good/Hazardous for AQI, µg/m³ for conc)\n- Description tip dynamically explains current mode and calibration status\n- road-aqi.ts: OSPM-inspired non-linear canyon model:\n  - canyonTrap: asymptotic 1→1.8× via 1-exp(-1.5*AR) (deep canyons plateau)\n  - windShelter: deep canyons reduce effective wind to 30-100% of ambient\n  - Replaces linear canyon_ratio × 0.5\n- RoadPollutionLayer: hook now returns RoadLayerMeta (wind, WAQI station, count)\n- Weather status bar in pollution panel: wind speed, WAQI station name, road count\n- Full prop threading: hook → MapController → LeafletMap → HomePage → Sheet","tree":{"sha":"7d909219d12fec840c4b6afa241ba43dcb1cd9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/7d909219d12fec840c4b6afa241ba43dcb1cd9d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/b602d344b9dc9de736bbb4d7b28948ab1bd60aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/r