stan-tech-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/commits/40112da5af8ce1898216cf3122f63b50eca25080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T12:13:16Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T12:13:16Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"feat(vayu): Phase 1 eLichens — 5-point baseline interpolation, O3 + PM10\n\n- Replace single-point fetchBaseline with fetchBaselineGrid (5-point bilinear interpolation: 4 corners + center, 60/40 weighting)\n- Per-road centroid interpolation for spatially varied baselines\n- O3 titration model: o3 = baseline.o3 - no2Delta * 0.4 (traffic destroys ozone)\n- PM10 coarse fraction: pm10 = baseline.pm10 + pm25Delta * 1.8 (tire/brake/road dust)\n- Extend PollutantType to 5 pollutants: aqi, pm25, no2, o3, pm10\n- Add O3 + PM10 color scales and getValue cases in RoadPollutionLayer\n- MapLayersSheet auto-renders 5 pollutant tabs via POLLUTANT_OPTIONS","tree":{"sha":"9e62a7d94cb5159f1fa64bf2d16c2b434bf1bdb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/9e62a7d94cb5159f1fa64bf2d16c2b434bf1bdb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/40112da5af8ce1898216cf3122f63b50eca25080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login"