il.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"fix(vayu): highway class-based traffic estimation for road pollution differentiation\n\nRoot cause: all roads defaulted to traffic=100 when DB had null traffic_base_estimate,\ncausing uniform coloring across entire cities (all green in Bali, all orange in Jakarta).\n\nFix:\n- HIGHWAY_TRAFFIC lookup: motorway=4000, primary=1500, residential=80, etc.\n- Lane count multiplier: 4-lane primary = 2x traffic of 2-lane primary\n- Width factor: narrower roads trap more pollution (inverse proportion)\n- Canyon ratio effect amplified (0.3 -> 0.5 coefficient)\n- Deterministic per-road jitter (±20% via osm_way_id hash) so same-class roads vary\n- Zoom-based line weight scaling (thicker at z16+, like eLichens)\n- Increased road limits per zoom level for denser coverage\n- Line opacity raised to 0.85 for better visibility\n\nExpected differentiation (baseline pm25=15):\n  motorway: AQI ~152 (orange/red)\n  primary:  AQI ~89  (yellow)\n  secondary: AQI ~74 (yellow-green)\n  residential: AQI ~59 (green)","tree":{"sha":"a60b4422cc4fa633c110b79c1ac1aacb14402d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/a60b4422cc4fa633c110b79c1ac1aacb14402d43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/a33752e6a101d833f0cadc73478d68c3efd114bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user