},"message":"fix(vayu): synthetic training data now covers all 14 regions\n\nPreviously lat/lon was sampled from a single Java/Bali bounding box\n(-8.8 to -5.0, 105 to 120) which completely missed all Sulawesi regions\n(sulsel, sulbar, sulteng, gorontalo, sulut, sultra).\n\nNow samples from actual region bounding boxes with weighted distribution:\n- Jawa/Bali regions: weight 0.8-2.0 (higher road density)\n- Sulawesi regions: weight 0.5-1.0\n- Ensures XGBoost model learns lat/lon patterns for ALL coverage areas","tree":{"sha":"147b36a63416242a08b734e9772ebe458025e513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/147b36a63416242a08b734e9772ebe458025e513"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/f7762f5c251a8a617d50713b7b7f419ff78d2c81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/commit/f7762f5c25