rain_lstm.py: LSTM temporal AQI forecasting (24h->6h)\n- feedback_loop.py: Route feedback loop (ERD 6.4, EMA accuracy)\n- grid_upgrade.py: H3 res 11->12 for dense urban areas\n- contributor_system.py: Verified Local Contributor tiers (ERD 10.2)\n- retrain_monthly.py + vayu-retrain.yml: Monthly retraining pipeline\n\nDB: Added route_feedback table to vayu_migration.sql\nChecklist: 187/196 (95.4%) — Stage 13 skipped (server constraint)","tree":{"sha":"a0a191c541f23f19b7b661a0d9b3119e9a03845f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/a0a191c541f23f19b7b661a0d9b3119e9a03845f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/8b85919e1524ae059c1e3e273d1a9501553c18df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/commit/8b85919e1524ae059c1e3e273d1a9501553c18df","node_id":"C_kwDORHelAdoAKDhiODU5MTllMTUyNGFlM