\nCore modules (6.1-6.6):\n- caline3.py: Full CALINE3 line-source dispersion with PG stability classes\n- grid_manager.py: H3 tiling + Supabase REST UPSERT\n- weather.py: Open-Meteo async/sync fetcher with fallback defaults\n- traffic.py: OSM heuristic + TomTom calibration + diurnal patterns\n- cultural_calendar.py: Nyepi, Lebaran, Galungan, New Year modifiers\n- osm_processor.py: Overpass query builders + region detection\n\nBackground jobs (6.7-6.9):\n- refresh_hotspots.py: Hot-tile CALINE3 recompute pipeline (Mode B)\n- ping_supabase.py: Keep-alive ping\n- export_parquet.py: Weekly aqi_grid snapshot to Parquet\n\nUnit tests (6.10-6.12): 63 tests all passing\n- test_caline3.py: AQI, stability, sigma, haversine, line-source, fleet\n- test_grid.py: H3 indexing, center roundtrip, k-ring\n- test_traffic.py: Base traffic, diurnal, cultural events, calibration","tree":{"sha":"8286045c55aeab5f0a8875cc0a9bc3435aaf5f41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/8286045c55aeab5f0a8875cc0a9bc3435aaf5f41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/commits/454bdccb5414d63a976e3f2340a57d690bd4af46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208147254?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Tristan-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/rep