an-tech-ai","id":208147254,"login":"Tristan-tech-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODGgTNg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tristan-tech-ai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/commits/c3f9a313c3f695319e000e5195bfcc62b8fabb8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T02:54:54Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T02:54:54Z","email":"craftify.world.ti@gmail.com","name":"Tristan"},"message":"feat: viewport-based POIs, category filter chips, visual hierarchy\n\n- POIs now load based on camera/viewport position, not device GPS\n- Auto-recalculate visible POIs on every zoom/pan (moveend + zoomend)\n- Calculate viewport radius from map bounds dynamically\n- Add filter chips below search bar (Restaurant, Cafe, Hotel, Park, etc.)\n- Filter standout: matching POIs get larger icons + labels at lower zoom\n- Non-matching POIs dimmed (40% opacity, smaller icons) when filter active\n- Category-aware icons: try types[] array when category doesn''t match\n- zIndexOffset hierarchy: highlighted +1000, dimmed -1000\n- Sparse data fallback: broader search when <3 results found\n- Search merges Google + ORS results for under-covered areas\n- POIs visible by default (showPOIs=true)\n- Grid snap adapts to zoom level for efficient fetching","tree":{"sha":"318ed337c46c14908b011803da290252e0a02739","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tech-ai/Breeva/git/trees/318ed337c46c14908b011803da290252e0a02739"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tristan-tec