://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/3ecce29172d0fc25c644f25f818639715c269753/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T09:25:33Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T12:15:33Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"Fix visualisation resizing in mfe1 components\n\nReplaced `@HostListener(''window:resize'')` with `ResizeObserver` in the\nfollowing components in `mfe1-container`:\n- BarChartShow\n- PieChartShow\n- ScatterPlotShow\n- DataShow\n\nThis ensures that the D3 charts re-render and resize correctly whenever\ntheir parent container is resized, even if the overall window size does\nnot change (e.g., when side panels toggle or internal layout changes).\nClean up observer in `ngOnDestroy` to prevent memory leaks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Bengreen <862908+Bengreen@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f99334b8e0d40eb898a2aa2e51705b9549425ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/2f99334b8e0d40eb898a2aa2e51705b9549425ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/3ecce29172d0fc25c644f25f818639715c269753","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_i