er`, process logs via `BatchLogRecordProcessor`, and attach contextual metadata (username, roles) using `SharedContextService`.\n* Hooked the shell''s `App` component to dynamically load and configure `SharedOtelService` with values from `MFE_CONFIG`.\n* Overhauled `mfe1-container/src/app/services/logger.service.ts` to automatically format console messages and forward them through the centralized `SharedOtelService`.\n\nCo-authored-by: Bengreen <862908+Bengreen@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"76a03eec2fb931d5ec196b96a3edae1144d2060a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/76a03eec2fb931d5ec196b96a3edae1144d2060a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/620e1cba03730b05cf7691c19068dcd0d0b711c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commit/620e1cba03730b05cf7691c19068dcd0d0b711c4","node_id":"C_kwDORHe3ctoAKDYyMGUxY2JhMDM3MzBiMDVjZjc2OTFjMTkwNjhkY2QwZDBiN