Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/7832f39451c5c0314c39b415063be51bb663268c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:13:11Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T08:17:51Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"docs: Create comprehensive architecture overview with Mermaid diagrams\n\nAdded ARCHITECTURE.md providing complete system overview with visual diagrams:\n\n## Document Contents:\n  ✓ High-level system architecture (Shell host + 2 MFE remotes)\n  ✓ System components breakdown:\n    - Shell Container (Angular 21 host application)\n    - MFE1 Container (Angular 21 remote)\n    - MFE2 Container (React 18 remote)\n    - Shared Library (mfe-shared singleton pattern)\n  ✓ Micro frontend remotes and runtime configuration\n  ✓ Module federation architecture and flow\n  ✓ Shared library pattern and npm link mechanism\n  ✓ Docker deployment architecture with port mapping\n  ✓ Data flow diagrams (user requests, state sync)\n  ✓ Complete technology stack overview\n  ✓ Architecture decision rationale\n  ✓ Related requirement references\n  ✓ Deployment checklist\n  ✓ Scaling considerations\n  ✓ Known gaps and improvements\n\n## Visual Diagrams (Mermaid):\n  • System overview: Browser → Shell Host → MFE Remotes + Shared Library\n  • Shell container components: Bootstrap → AppComponent → Router → Config\n  • MFE1 architecture: Module structure + shared library consumption\n  • MFE2 architecture: React app + Angular wrapper component\n  • Shared library structure: Services, models, utilities\n  • Runtime configuration: MFE + menu definitions\n  • Federation architecture: Build-time + Runtime flows\n  • npm link mechanism: Singleton pattern sequence diagram\n  • Docker deployment: Port mapping and container orchestration\n  • Technology stack: Frontend frameworks + infrastructure\n  • Data flow: User request → Remote load, State synchronization\n\n## Updated:\n  • spec/README.md:\n    - Added ARCHITECTURE.md to Quick Navigation\n    - Updated directory structure to include architecture doc\n    - Enhanced documentation flow\n\nThis serves as the single source of truth for understanding the\ncurrent system architecture, component relationships, and deployment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"58476cccd0ed889a31399c17e4b0d7c5a512e0d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/58476cccd0ed889a31399c17e4b0d7c5a512e0d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/7832f39451c5c0314c39b415063be51bb663268c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starr