name":"Ben Greene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T08:17:51Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"refactor: Remove legacy architecture, implemented, and pending directories\n\nThese directories were placeholder/index directories that became redundant\nafter consolidating all content into the modular requirements system.\n\nChanges:\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/architecture/ - All 4 architecture specs now in requirements/architecture/\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/implemented/ - Implementation status tracked in requirements/ (REQ status field)\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/pending/ - All 15 work items now embedded in requirement files\n  ✓ Updated: spec/README.md - Documented directory cleanup in Legacy Files section\n\nFinal spec structure (completely consolidated):\n  spec/\n  ├── DOCUMENTATION_ANALYSIS.md    # Issue tracking\n  ├── README.md                    # Navigation & guidance\n  └── requirements/                # SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH\n      ├── README.md                # Index of all 17 requirements\n      ├── architecture/            # REQ-A001 to REQ-A004\n      ├── features/                # REQ-F005 to REQ-F013\n      └── documentation/           # REQ-D014 to REQ-D017\n\nAll specification, work items, implementation status, and navigation\nnow unified in requirements/ with no separate index directories.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbf49e0787fbd1e0ee12e055302f214c0d00b530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/cbf49e0787fbd1e0ee12e055302f214c0d00b530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/c4996dfbfd22028eb820a21f0e9228f99fe313cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu