s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/26ac3c420d2097605c2e55de64eb723f4a876dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:08:45Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T08:17:51Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"refactor: Remove superfluous tasks directory and update navigation\n\nThe tasks/ directory became redundant after consolidating all work items\ninto requirement files. This cleanup completes the unified spec system.\n\nChanges:\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/tasks/ directory (no longer needed)\n  ✓ Updated: spec/README.md to remove all tasks/ references\n    - Removed directory structure that included tasks/\n    - Updated navigation examples to use requirement files directly\n    - Updated Adding New Work Items instructions\n    - Updated implementation workflow (add to requirement, not separate file)\n    - Updated legacy files section (marked tasks/ as deleted)\n    - Updated FAQ to point to requirement files instead of tasks/\n\nNow Complete:\n  • spec/requirements/ - 17 requirement files with embedded work items\n  • spec/DOCUMENTATION_ANALYSIS.md - Issue tracking\n  • spec/README.md - Navigation and guidance\n  • No redundant files or directories\n\nNavigation is now:\n  Open requirement file → Find \"Work Items\" section\n  Open requirement file → Find \"Implementation Results\" section\n  No context switching between multiple files\n\nAll spec system consolidation complete:\n  ✓ SPECIFICATIONS.md removed\n  ✓ WORK.md removed\n  ✓ WORK_ITEMS.md removed\n  ✓ tasks/ directory removed\n  ✓ 17 requirement files contain all: spec + work + implementation\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc92f0910e567fd836e70a776aa231217af52384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/cc92f0910e567fd836e70a776aa231217af52384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/26ac3c420d2097605c2e55de64eb723f4a876dbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commit/26ac3c420d2097605c2e55de64eb723f4a876dbf","node_id":"C_kwDORHe3ctoAKDI2YWMzYzQyMGQyMDk3NjA1YzJlNTVkZTY0ZWI3MjNmNGE4NzZkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commit/16ef3cdebbeb00c0d724d9cf3bc8f0580bf8f223","sha":"16ef3cdebbeb00c0d724d9cf3bc8f0580bf8f223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/16ef3cdebbeb00c0d724d9cf3bc8f0580bf8f223"}],"sha":"26ac3c420d2097605c2e55de64eb723f4a876dbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/26ac3c420d2097605c2e55de64eb723f4a876dbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/16ef3cdebbeb00c0d724d9cf3bc8f0580bf8f223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:06:49Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T08:17:51Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"refactor: Consolidate work items into requirement files\n\nMerged WORK.md and WORK_ITEMS.md content into the requirement files to create\na unified, single-source-of-truth specification system.\n\nChanges:\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/WORK.md (508 lines)\n  ✓ Deleted: spec/WORK_ITEMS.md (612 lines)\n  ✓ Merged 15 work items into corresponding requirements:\n    - REQ-D014: DOC-002, DOC-004, DOC-005 (3 work items)\n    - REQ-D015: DOC-001 ✅, DOC-003, DOC-008 (3 work items + 1 completed)\n    - REQ-D016: DOC-009 (1 work item, blocked)\n    - REQ-D017: DOC-006 (1 work item)\n    - REQ-A004: DOC-007, DOC-005, DOCKER-001 (3 work items)\n    - REQ-F010: FEAT-002 (1 work item)\n    - REQ-F011: TEST-001 (1 work item)\n    - REQ-F012: DOCKER-001 (1 work item)\n    - REQ-F013: FEAT-003 (1 work item)\n  ✓ Updated spec/README.md navigation and FAQ\n  ✓ Updated spec/tasks/README.md to document pattern\n\nNew Structure:\n  Each requirement file (REQ-###.md) now includes:\n    • Description & Rationale\n    • Key Implementation Points\n    • Current Status\n    • Implementation Results (if completed)\n    • Work Items section:\n      - Full work item details (priority, status, effort)\n      - Problem statement and proposed solution\n      - Acceptance criteria\n      - Files to change / create\n      - Related issues and dependencies\n    • Related Requirements (cross-links)\n\nBenefits:\n  ✓ Single source of truth: requirement defines spec + all its work\n  ✓ No context switching: spec, implementation, and work in one place\n  ✓ Cleaner navigation: open requirement file and find everything\n  ✓ Better dependencies: see blocking relationships inline\n  ✓ Reduced files: eliminated 2 files (1,120 lines of duplication)\n  ✓ Easier updates: change spec and work together, not separately\n\nWork Item Status Summary:\n  • 1 ✅ Complete: DOC-001 (MFE1 test runner docs)\n  • 14 ⏳ Pending: Various doc, feature, test, and infra tasks\n  • Blocked: DOC-009 (waiting on DOC-001-005 completion)\n  • Low priority: FEAT-003, DOCKER-001, F010 proposed work\n\nNew Navigation (from spec/README.md):\n  • Open requirement → scroll to Work Items section\n  • See priority, status, effort, acceptance criteria\n  • Follow cross-links to related requirements\n  • No separate work item file needed\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd0f75baf359d50d1a96636b2a0419ce9490f013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/bd0f75baf359d50d1a96636b2a0419ce9490f013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/16ef3cdebbeb00c0d724d9cf3bc8f0580bf8f223","verifi