en/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commits/20656476e0ea9e543c6d6ecf4218f52f2fef8818/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:01:30Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T08:17:51Z","email":"BenJGreene@gmail.com","name":"Ben Greene"},"message":"refactor: Move task implementation results into requirement files\n\nTask completion details are now integrated directly into requirement files\nto maintain a single source of truth for both specification and implementation.\n\nChanges:\n  ✓ Deleted spec/tasks/DOC-001.md (implementation results merged)\n  ✓ Merged DOC-001 completion data into REQ-D015.md:\n    - What Was Changed section\n    - 8 UAT test scenarios with status\n    - Implementation verification checklist\n  ✓ Updated spec/tasks/README.md to explain new pattern\n  ✓ Updated spec/README.md navigation to point to requirement files\n  ✓ Updated directory structure documentation\n\nNew Structure:\n  • requirements/[category]/REQ-###.md now includes:\n    - Description & Rationale (always)\n    - Key Implementation Points (always)\n    - Implementation Results (when completed)\n    - UAT Status (when completed)\n\n  • tasks/README.md now serves as pattern documentation\n  • WORK.md continues to track work item status\n  • requirements/README.md is central index\n\nBenefits:\n  • Single source of truth: requirement file documents both what and what-was-done\n  • Implementation context preserved with the requirement\n  • UAT steps live alongside their corresponding specs\n  • Reduced file proliferation\n  • Clearer narrative of requirement → implementation → verification\n\nExample: To see DOC-001 task completion, open:\n  → requirements/documentation/REQ-D015.md (scroll to Implementation Results)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"151811a4833f87a27a889a3e2ae1c5298f398cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/trees/151811a4833f87a27a889a3e2ae1c5298f398cc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/git/commits/20656476e0ea9e543c6d6ecf4218f52f2fef8818","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bengreen","id":862908,"login":"Bengreen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjkwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bengreen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PolecatWorks/Mfe-shell/commit/20656476e0ea9e543c6d6ecf4218f52f2fef8818","node_id":"C_kwDORHe3ctoAKDIwNjU2NDc2ZTBlYTllNTQzYzZkNmVjZjQy