claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commits/4121fba34b45a01c5d4ddc44002151e963ef556f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:05:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:05:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix workspace persistence with minikube mount bridge\n\nProblem: With Minikube''s Docker driver, there''s a path mismatch:\n- docker run -v uses paths on the HOST machine\n- Pod hostPath uses paths inside Minikube container\nThese are different locations, so files written by MCP agents\nwere not visible in the orchestrator pods.\n\nSolution: Use minikube mount to bridge host and Minikube paths:\n- Host: $HOME/claude-workspace\n- Minikube: /data/claude-workspace (mapped via minikube mount)\n- Docker run uses host path, pods use Minikube path\n- Both point to the same actual storage via the mount\n\nChanges:\n- Add start-workspace-mount.sh script to run minikube mount\n- Add workspace-config.yaml ConfigMap for path configuration\n- Update orchestrator deployment to use ConfigMap for WORKSPACE_PATH\n- Update deploy.sh to:\n  - Create workspace-config ConfigMap with correct host path\n  - Show instructions to start the mount\n\nUsage:\n1. Run ./scripts/deploy.sh\n2. In a separate terminal: ./scripts/start-workspace-mount.sh\n3. Files created by agents will now appear in both:\n   - Host: $HOME/claude-workspace\n   - Pod: /workspace\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A","tree":{"sha":"7bfaf41212b9bb1c6c02d1f9bfaeacae26a3a663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/trees/7bfaf41212b9bb1c6c02d1f9bfaeacae26a3a663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/commits/4121fba34b45a01c5d4ddc44002151e963ef556f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bfaf41212b9bb1c6c02d1f9bfaeacae26a3a663\nparent 8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770156310 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770156310 +0000\n\nFix workspace persistence with minikube mount bridge\n\nProblem: With Minikube''s Docker driver, there''s a path mismatch:\n- docker run -v uses paths on the HOST machine\n- Pod hostPath uses paths inside Minikube container\nThese are different locations, so files written by MCP agents\nwere not visible in the orchestrator pods.\n\nSolution: Use minikube mount to bridge host and Minikube paths:\n- Host: $HOME/claude-workspace\n- Minikube: /data/claude-workspace (mapped via minikube mount)\n- Docker run uses host path, pods use Minikube path\n- Both point to the same actual storage via the mount\n\nChanges:\n- Add start-workspace-mount.sh script to run minikube mount\n- Add workspace-config.yaml ConfigMap for path configuration\n- Update orchestrator deployment to use ConfigMap for WORKSPACE_PATH\n- Update deploy.sh to:\n  - Create workspace-config ConfigMap with correct host path\n  - Show instructions to start the mount\n\nUsage:\n1. Run ./scripts/deploy.sh\n2. In a separate terminal: ./scripts/start-workspace-mount.sh\n3. Files created by agents will now appear in both:\n   - Host: $HOME/claude-workspace\n   - Pod: /workspace\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHbZPlT4\njUiYy0sCOGmdlgpqR3BgWfRajc+NlovdYqnK0nUWNGy+5hOd3WJ2Ez3HVQ2MfqayTMgfbPoiuP9i\nWwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-03T22:05:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commit/4121fba34b45a01c5d4ddc44002151e963ef556f","node_id":"C_kwDORH2OftoAKDQxMjFmYmEzNGI0NWEwMWM1ZDRkZGM0NDAwMjE1MWU5NjNlZjU1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commit/8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39","sha":"8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commits/8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39"}],"sha":"4121fba34b45a01c5d4ddc44002151e963ef556f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commits/4121fba34b45a01c5d4ddc44002151e963ef556f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commits/8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:57:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:57:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add persistent workspace for MCP agent files\n\nProblem: Files created by MCP agents were stored in ephemeral volumes\nand lost when containers were deleted. The docker run -v path\nreferenced the Docker host, not the orchestrator container.\n\nSolution:\n- Use hostPath volume (/data/claude-workspace) on Minikube node\n- This path is accessible from both:\n  1. Orchestrator pods (mounted at /workspace)\n  2. Docker-spawned MCP containers (via docker run -v)\n- Files now persist across container restarts\n\nChanges:\n- Add workspace-pvc.yaml with hostPath PV/PVC\n- Update orchestrator deployment:\n  - WORKSPACE_PATH=/data/claude-workspace (for docker run)\n  - Mount hostPath at /workspace\n- Update MCP server deployment with same hostPath\n- Add /workspace endpoint to list files created by agents\n- Add /workspace/<path> endpoint to view file contents\n- Update deploy.sh to create workspace directory on Minikube\n- Add WORKSPACE_LOCAL config for filesystem checks\n\nTo view files created by agents:\n  kubectl exec -n backend deploy/orchestrator -- ls -la /workspace/\n  curl http://<orchestrator>:8080/workspace\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A","tree":{"sha":"33d626c54ed79ba72bb0fde79569eb02f2837f64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/trees/33d626c54ed79ba72bb0fde79569eb02f2837f64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/commits/8a52ff68d0b17f095260429caa5d0e95211c0a39","verification":{"payload":"tree 33d626c54ed79ba72bb0fde79569eb02f2837f64\nparent 8158cd05ab415dc09a3d9bb681333a45c959d53e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770152230 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770152230 +0000\n\nAdd persistent workspace for MCP agent files\n\nProblem: Files created by MCP agents were stored in ephemeral volumes\nand lost when containers were deleted. The docker run -v path\nreferenced the Docker host, not the orchestrator container.\n\nSolution:\n- Use hostPath volume (/data/claude-workspace) on Minikube node\n- This path is accessible from both:\n  1. Orchestrator pods (mounted at /workspace)\n  2. Docker-spawned MCP containers (via docker run -v)\n- Files now persist across container restarts\n\nChanges:\n- Add workspace-pvc.yaml with hostPath PV/PVC\n- Update orchestrator deployment:\n  - WORKSPACE_PATH=/data/claude-workspace (for docker run)\n  - Mount hostPath at /workspace\n- Update MCP server deployment with same hostPath\n- Add /workspace endpoint to list files created by agents\n- Add /workspace/<path> endpoint to view file contents\n- Update deploy.sh to create workspace directory on Minikube\n- Add WORKSPACE_LOCAL config for filesystem checks\n\nTo view files created by agents:\n  kubectl exec -n backend deploy/orchestrator -- ls -la /workspace/\n  curl http://<orchestrator>:8080/workspace\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A\n","reason":"valid","signature":"---