81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/commits/8158cd05ab415dc09a3d9bb681333a45c959d53e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:33:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:33:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add diagnostics and increase resources for Docker access\n\n- Add /diagnostics endpoint to check Docker availability:\n  - Docker CLI presence\n  - Docker socket accessibility\n  - Docker daemon status\n  - MCP image availability\n- Add /test-docker endpoint for quick Docker test\n- Add pre-flight Docker check in run_agent function\n- Increase orchestrator memory limits (512Mi->2Gi) to prevent OOM\n- Increase CPU limits (1000m->2000m) for better performance\n- Add detailed logging for agent execution\n\nThese changes help diagnose the \"exit code -9\" error by providing\nvisibility into Docker connectivity from within the pod.\n\nTo diagnose issues, use:\n  curl http://<orchestrator-service>:8080/diagnostics\n  curl http://<orchestrator-service>:8080/test-docker\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A","tree":{"sha":"3e36b68281b90cf8ebe80d1f982fbff91dc648a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/trees/3e36b68281b90cf8ebe80d1f982fbff91dc648a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tedescomicchidev/MultiClaudeMCPTest/git/commits/8158cd05ab415dc09a3d9bb681333a45c959d53e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e36b68281b90cf8ebe80d1f982fbff91dc648a9\nparent 36ab73bf8b2ee32a3655de56b60a3c3f53f1c645\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770150800 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1770150800 +0000\n\nAdd diagnostics and increase resources for Docker access\n\n- Add /diagnostics endpoint to check Docker availability:\n  - Docker CLI presence\n  - Docker socket accessibility\n  - Docker daemon status\n  - MCP image availability\n- Add /test-docker endpoint for quick Docker test\n- Add pre-flight Docker check in run_agent function\n- Increase orchestrator memory limits (512Mi->2Gi) to prevent OOM\n- Increase CPU limits (1000m->2000m) for better performance\n- Add detailed logging for agent execution\n\nThese changes help diagnose the \"exit code -9\" error by providing\nvisibility into Docker connectivity from within the pod.\n\nTo diagnose issues, use:\n  curl http://<orchestrator-service>:8080/diagnostics\n  curl http://<orchestrator-service>:8080/test-docker\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01V73h5bf6iomUsp2EwZzQ4A\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAlfYo2z\n2Yz05HCDpJC46odcSO/YZyvR/1Wl2kzz1IkLFqZwfPYBdcfAwvYF+mm+CIvSkKvS5H9ORWRfutNx\nHgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-03T20:33:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl