"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/commits/129cc6fab3bc4bf8724b9cb85d7c0112175360f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:35:00Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:35:00Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"message":"Offer only models the free tier actually serves; default to flash-lite\n\nA free Gemini key reports a quota limit of 0 for gemini-2.0-flash,\ngemini-2.0-flash-lite and gemini-2.5-pro, so every one of those in the\nmodel dropdown was a guaranteed 429 for whoever picked it. Drop them.\n\nDefault to gemini-2.5-flash-lite: it has the largest free-tier daily\nquota and generated correct SQL for this schema in testing, where\ngemini-2.5-flash exhausts its daily allowance after a handful of\nquestions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cac6f12b18e24ba95ba190094fe594c882cb51f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/trees/cac6f12b18e24ba95ba190094fe594c882cb51f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/commits/129cc6fab3bc4bf8724b9cb85d7c0112175360f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/murdskristians","id":38564313,"login":"murdskristians","node_id":"MDQ