6bf5c213b083d37b9e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:32:56Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:32:56Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"message":"Add synthetic demo dataset, rate limiting, and Render deployment config\n\nThe public demo previously pointed at real business data through an\nunauthenticated endpoint. Point it at generated data instead.\n\n- demo/seed_demo_data.py generates a fictional construction-procurement\n  dataset (materials -> tenders -> offers, plus transports and staff) into\n  the smartsuite_demo dataset. Deterministic; contains no real records.\n- rate_limit.py caps per-IP requests, since the demo endpoint is public and\n  each chat call costs Gemini quota and BigQuery scan. Registered inside CORS\n  so 429s still carry CORS headers and surface as a real message in the UI.\n- render.yaml deploys the backend to Render. Credentials come from a service\n  account scoped to the demo dataset only, verified as unable to read the\n  production dataset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddbd960f9932a9bb78f6d1eb60ddd0f7d875cafb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/trees/ddbd960f9932a9bb78f6d1eb60ddd0f7d875cafb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/commits/6011f780b5e3883a7fb66bf5c213b083d37b9e2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: