e,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/commits/8302702e0fe7e7b9cb164e04e6e86f4566a65cca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-10T07:35:41Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-10T07:35:41Z","email":"murdskristians@gmail.com","name":"Kristians"},"message":"Add Thinking Mode toggle for AI-powered query result analysis\n\n- Add backend /api/chat/analyze-results endpoint for AI insights\n- Implement ThinkingModeToggle component with localStorage persistence\n- Update ChatContext to analyze results when thinking mode is enabled\n- Add AI Analysis messages with special gradient styling\n- Display \"-\" for empty/null values in result tables\n- Show \"Empty\" for missing column types in table headers\n\nThe thinking mode provides additional AI-generated insights about query\nresults, helping users understand patterns, trends, and anomalies in their data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af8a14fe9b04f5ba7cefbba50edae3b5b403d742","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/trees/af8a14fe9b04f5ba7cefbba50edae3b5b403d742"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/murdskristians/BigQueryAIChat/git/commits/8302702e0fe7e7b9cb164e04e6e86f4566a65cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38564313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murdskristians/following{/other_u